<title>FRANCE: French cocoa bean imports down yr/yr in November.</title>
<headline>French cocoa bean imports down yr/yr in November.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>French November cocoa bean imports issued by French customs (in tonnes) -</p>
<p>		  Nov 96    Nov 95    Jan/Nov 96    Jan/Nov 95</p>
<p> Ivory Coast  4,563     4,046	59,415	  60,108</p>
<p> Ghana	    625     2,567	13,051	  14,757</p>
<p> Nigeria	1,603	 982	10,588	   5,074</p>
<p> Cameroon     1,181	 815	 9,806	   9,457</p>
<p> Indonesia	612	 846	 9,267	   9,645</p>
<p> World total  9,305    10,132     109,014	 107,390</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
